          {
            "typeName": "notesText",
            "multiple": false,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "Production date: 01-2024---- 05-2024<br>\nMethod: Data on information security breaches through manual search of the Internet, financial data through Refinitiv (LSEG). (Approval obtained from Refinitiv to publish these data)<br>\nUniverse: S&P500 companies<br>\nCountry / Nation: USA\n<br><br>\nThe six spreadsheet files (one-sheet xlsx files) are also present in their preferred file format csv. Preferred formats are file formats of which DANS – based on international agreements – is confident that they will offer the best long-term guarantees in terms of usability, accessibility and sustainability. For more information on preferred file formats, see <a href=\"https://dans.knaw.nl/en/file-formats\">https://dans.knaw.nl/en/file-formats/</a>."
